[{"title":"奉寄杜侍郎先生","author":"岳正","text":"文场昔日旧持衡，玉笋班尘第一名。\n交谊敢同金谷醉，宦游偶伴玉堂荣。\n心知散地淹豪杰，首在先朝荐老成。\n十载相违双鬓雪，不才今已负门生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送定西蒋侯出镇甘肃 其一","author":"岳正","text":"重镇雄藩最上游，三边西去是甘州。\n封疆出塞犹千里，人物中朝第一流。\n公暇含毫吟蟋蟀，日长挥羽练貔貅。\n经阳部曲今犹在，应说风流似祖侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送定西蒋侯出镇甘肃 其二","author":"岳正","text":"介老归朝众所闻，登坛又见读书人。\n先公向此开茅土，五郡于今待抚循。\n黄发有谋终可信，苍头无赖不须亲。\n莫嫌潦倒多言语，身是三危旧逐臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答孔宗文大理问出期","author":"岳正","text":"一自先朝感赐环，年来习懒渐成顽。\n江河既导宜宗海，麇鹿难驯却恋山。\n已觉梦曾惊虎口，岂知身复簉鹓班。\n闭门不是图高尚，祗恐相逢益厚颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸公会荐兵部侍郎得迁福建知府留别京朝诸友","author":"岳正","text":"清朝求士渴思浆，虚负诸公此荐章。\n先帝有怀曾赐召，孤臣无命合投荒。\n独愁新路开荆棘，敢谓长才是庙廊。\n关塞江湖皆万里，壮游心事却粗偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仙溪郑氏义聚堂","author":"岳正","text":"闻道松庵老达尊，家传寸地至今存。\n一堂和气兄犹弟，三世同心祖又孙。\n灯火夜深归院落，犁锄春暖遍郊村。\n莆阳人物应无算，礼义人人说郑门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莆阳(1)迎春","author":"岳正","text":"万里飘风一逐臣，帝教再起牧吾民。\n非才窃愧天边宠，病体难胜海上春。\n箫鼓暂同田舍乐，庖厨不减布衣贫。\n故园松菊应无恙，总辨芳心待主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南山登高和周太守韵 其一","author":"岳正","text":"尘坱无端竟日侵，招提快与故人临。\n龙山事往成陈迹，莲社僧高识秽心。\n岭海此身千里外，故园回首五云深。\n何当棹却扁舟去，不问人间绂与簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南山登高和周太守韵 其二","author":"岳正","text":"罗衣不怯晓寒侵，山寺追陪五马临。\n总是龙山遗俗会，须知鸡黍故人心。\n归田莫待桑榆晚，为客应惭岁月深。\n寄语西风休落帽，孟嘉头已不胜簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南山登高和周太守韵 其三","author":"岳正","text":"无奈闲愁万种侵，重阳况在客中临。\n至今人爱登高节，自古谁知赏菊心。\n齐国江山悲感后，楚王台榭草莱深。\n未能免俗聊随俗，也把茱萸上鬓簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝","author":"岳正","text":"水苍火齐逗精光，一道平溪两岸芳。\n竞富石家红锦障，赌棋康乐紫罗囊。\n摘来磈磊砂初结，嚼罢冷瀼露已霜。\n却念天庖供御府，孤臣无路荐甘香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老梅","author":"岳正","text":"几年漂泊海天涯，谁送清贫太守家。\n一节自教生意足，寸心人作死灰夸。\n维摩老病依天女，姑射新妆泛月槎。\n好是东君消息近，残冬先著早春花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈教授之潮州","author":"岳正","text":"莆阳十日到潮阳，彼此同风即故乡。\n家近不忧通问少，官闲但苦作诗忙。\n鳣堂日转榕荫合，马帐风回荔枝香。\n太守幸逢乡曲好，相过应不废槟榔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周廷粲起复知饶州","author":"岳正","text":"忆昔同探杏花春，相逢半是惜春人。\n我归仍守渔矶旧，君去重分虎竹新。\n赠别辞荒惭芍药，颂功心切赞麒麟。\n番阳便是登仙路，莫向湖头再问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李行素携子东阳编修茶陵访祖","author":"岳正","text":"帝许南还著锦衣，故山草木坐增辉。\n路从白马湖边过，身与苍龙阙暂违。\n几处聚观元献隽，千年争讶令威归。\n秋风肯念并州旧，莫谓衡阳少雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日三绝 其一","author":"岳正","text":"木落江寒秋已赊，不堪时节促年华。\n只应怀古成长啸，闲向空庭嗅菊花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日三绝 其二","author":"岳正","text":"菊花又报一年秋，聊复凭高解我忧。\n秋水长天那更得，子安才调尚淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日三绝 其三","author":"岳正","text":"雨中篱菊破轻黄，风外金橙试远香。\n欲上龙山高处望，不胜秋色逼重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面小景","author":"岳正","text":"小阁临江虚欲流，长松满地烟未收。\n孤舟何处晚归急，惊起波心双白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"岳正","text":"玉质谁教吐绛英，碧栏干外一枝横。\n只应春色浓如酒，醉倚东风睡未醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌鹊","author":"岳正","text":"翩翩乌鹊来何处，夜深误落城头树。\n风枝搅梦栖不成，和月飞归上林去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送俞士栗归南都 其一","author":"岳正","text":"胜游眼界隘寰区，如意声高缺唾壶。\n闻道上林花最好，又随春色到皇都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送俞士栗归南都 其二","author":"岳正","text":"扁舟东去背西风，数幅轻帆一望中。\n飞尽芦花雪欲下，带将秋色过江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送俞士栗归南都 其三","author":"岳正","text":"灵槎明日渡江南，天上风情想尽谙。\n记得霓裳三两调，等闲休便向人谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送俞士栗归南都 其四","author":"岳正","text":"碧波晴映舞衣斑，家住秦淮占一湾。\n莫道紫芝随处有，钟山原不是商山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈图南小像","author":"岳正","text":"点检陈桥已著鞭，先生归伴白云眠。\n务光不与人间事，却浪相传是睡仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陶谷邮亭图","author":"岳正","text":"雪水烹茶诧党姬，玉堂明日有人知。\n如何千里江南使，又向邮亭制小词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花鸟图 其一","author":"岳正","text":"路入仙源世已迷，洞门霞绕碧天低。\n刘郎不解春将老，只为思归日夜啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花鸟图 其二","author":"岳正","text":"侍宴归来簇绛云，夜深冷露透猩裙。\n阿环唤醒纱橱梦，间拂菱花照宿醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花鸟图 其三","author":"岳正","text":"霜染平江翠欲飞，波心夜半度灵妃。\n可怜一掬苍梧泪，拭遍当年旧制衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花鸟图 其四","author":"岳正","text":"姑射仙人跨翠鸾，风前环佩响珊珊。\n玉箫吹彻江南意，孤梦回时月正寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰","author":"岳正","text":"曾倚东风嗅国香，星轺此日度沅湘。\n于今客里看图画，搔首无言只自伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至邢台二十里铺题壁","author":"岳正","text":"欲凭赤手缚顽鲸，多少行人笑独醒。\n万里玉关何处是，不堪飞梦绕亲庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过潼关","author":"岳正","text":"白头关吏诘来情，惭愧人人识姓名。\n却说防秋曾到处，肃州尽是镇边城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金汝潜使甘肃","author":"岳正","text":"我别甘泉又两秋，烦君传语旧同游。\n林泉不许山人卧，又遣朝簪簪白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"濯足","author":"岳正","text":"踏遍天涯两足存，西驰未定又南奔。\n人间有水皆堪濯，何必沧浪一段浑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e